      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Offset advanced in RAM -> capped flush -> state saved\nWhen rows remain buffered, a crash can lose unpublished events already covered by the saved offset.\nPersist pending rows or checkpoint only the contiguous published prefix.",
